<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<title>Free Deployments | HeartCode Admin</title>
</head>
<body data-page="free">
<div class="admin-shell">
  <%- include('../partials/nav', { activePage: 'free' }) %>
  <main class="admin-main">
    <section class="admin-page-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="admin-eyebrow">Sales</p>
        <h1>Free Deployments</h1>
        <p>A website type priced at $0 is free. The visitor confirms their email with a one-time link before the site is deployed. Each email gets one free site, free sites are kept out of revenue, and they delete themselves after the days you set below.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-stat-grid" id="freeStats"></section>

    <section class="admin-card max-w-xl">
      <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Limits</p><h2>Settings</h2></div></div>
      <form id="freeForm">
        <label class="admin-label" for="dailyCap">Free deployments per day</label>
        <input class="admin-input" type="number" id="dailyCap" min="0" max="1000" step="1" required>
        <p class="admin-hint" style="margin:4px 0 14px;color:#667085;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;">Counted when the email link is opened. Once this is reached, visitors are told to try again tomorrow. Set 0 to close free deployments. The day resets at midnight UTC.</p>

        <label class="admin-label" for="verifyDailyMax">Confirmation emails per day</label>
        <input class="admin-input" type="number" id="verifyDailyMax" min="0" max="5000" step="1" required>
        <p class="admin-hint" style="margin:4px 0 14px;color:#667085;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;">A hard ceiling on link emails, so free requests can never use up your daily email allowance. Each free site also sends one "site ready" email.</p>

        <label class="admin-label" for="expiryDays">Free site lasts (days)</label>
        <input class="admin-input" type="number" id="expiryDays" min="1" max="30" step="1" required>
        <p class="admin-hint" style="margin:4px 0 14px;color:#667085;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;">1 to 30. After this the site stops loading and is deleted from ClarityHeart. Applies to sites deployed from now on.</p>

        <label class="admin-label" for="linkMinutes">Email link works for (minutes)</label>
        <input class="admin-input" type="number" id="linkMinutes" min="5" max="120" step="1" required>

        <label class="admin-label" for="blockedList">Extra blocked emails and domains</label>
        <textarea class="admin-textarea" id="blockedList" rows="8" placeholder="one per line, for example:&#10;spammer@example.com&#10;throwaway-mail.net"></textarea>
        <p class="admin-hint" style="margin:4px 0 14px;color:#667085;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;">Paste as many as you like, one per line. An address blocks just that address, a domain blocks everyone on it. Duplicates and blank lines are removed when you save. About <span id="builtInCount">100</span> well-known disposable domains are already blocked for you.</p>

        <div class="mt-4"><button type="submit" class="admin-btn">Save</button></div>
      </form>
      <p id="freeMsg" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-card" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Latest</p><h2>Recent free requests</h2></div></div>
      <div class="admin-table-wrap">
        <table class="admin-table is-responsive-stack" id="freeTable">
          <thead><tr><th>Email</th><th>Status</th><th>Requested</th><th>Site</th><th>Site ends</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="freeRows"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p id="freeEmpty" class="admin-hint" style="display:none;margin:12px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:13px;">No free requests yet.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
<script src="/dashboard-assets/admin-free.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
